"""Source-bound provisional top-outer cleat pair and local integration screen.

The producer consumes an already retained WJ-12/WJ-16 composition. It never
materializes a family. The two top duties remain an unaccepted hypothesis;
the host-cut maps are exported separately so a parent composition can merge
them without replacing its existing shared-host cuts.
"""

